# The private signing key must never be committed. The previous patterns were
# `cosign.key` and `*.key`, which both MISS `cosign.key.gpg` -- and that is
# exactly how the encrypted key ended up published in commit 7960b21 on
# 2026-07-31, public for 10 days until an audit on 2026-08-10.
cosign.key*
*.key
*.key.gpg
